  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Finely chop celery. Roughly chop tomato. Thinly slice silverbeet. Drain cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667a98b5438760e4ef4144c8-e13e89dc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• On a second lined oven tray, place Parmesan cheese in even circles to make two per person.\n• Bake until golden and crisp around the edges, 6-8 minutes (these can burn fast, so keep an eye on them!). TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, bake the Parmesan crisps in batches. TIP: The Parmesan crisps will crisp up as they cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667a98b5438760e4ef4144c8-c77050e3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook celery, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add tomato paste and garlic and cook, stirring until fragrant, 30 seconds.\n• Add tomato, the water, garlic & herb seasoning, salt, the butter and brown sugar. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, stirring occasionally, until thickened slightly, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add silverbeet, cannellini beans and roasted veggies. Continue to simmer until silverbeet is wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667a98b5438760e4ef4144c8-9f8fa89f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian white bean and veggie soup between bowls.\n• Top with basil pesto and Parmesan crisps.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667a98b5438760e4ef4144c8-16a97a04.jpeg"
    }
  ]
